## Phase 10: IParsable<T> & Parsing Modernization
Migrate to standard .NET IParsable<T>/ISpanParsable<T> interfaces for consistent parsing that integrates with generic constraints and modern .NET APIs.

**Pattern:** Follow CssColor exemplar. Keep parser classes as internal implementation called by type's TryParse. IFormatProvider parameter ignored (CSS is locale-independent).

### 10.1 Simple Value Types
- [ ] CssAnB (CSS/Types/)
  - [ ] Implement IParsable<CssAnB>, ISpanParsable<CssAnB>
  - [ ] Delegate to CssAnBParser internally
  - [ ] Mark CssAnBParser.Parse(string) as [Obsolete]
- [ ] CssUnicodeRange (CSS/Types/)
  - [ ] Implement IParsable<CssUnicodeRange>, ISpanParsable<CssUnicodeRange>
  - [ ] Delegate to CssUnicodeRangeParser internally
  - [ ] Mark CssUnicodeRangeParser.Parse(string) as [Obsolete]

### 10.2 URL Types
- [ ] Url (URL/Base/)
  - [ ] Implement IParsable<Url>, ISpanParsable<Url>
  - [ ] Wrap existing Url.TryParse() logic
- [ ] IPV4Address (URL/Types/)
  - [ ] Implement IParsable<IPV4Address>, ISpanParsable<IPV4Address>
- [ ] IPV6Address (URL/Types/)
  - [ ] Implement IParsable<IPV6Address>, ISpanParsable<IPV6Address>
- [ ] UrlHost (URL/Types/)
  - [ ] Implement IParsable<UrlHost>, ISpanParsable<UrlHost>
- [ ] UrlOrigin (URL/Types/)
  - [ ] Implement IParsable<UrlOrigin>, ISpanParsable<UrlOrigin>

### 10.3 Color Types
- [ ] CssColorHdr (RenderEngine/Color/)
  - [ ] Implement IParsable<CssColorHdr>, ISpanParsable<CssColorHdr>
  - [ ] Delegate to CssColorFunctionParser internally

### 10.4 CSS Value Types (Token-Based - Facade Pattern)
These parse from token streams; IParsable facade tokenizes string first, then delegates to parser.
- [ ] CssValue (CSS/Value/)
  - [ ] Implement IParsable<CssValue>, ISpanParsable<CssValue>
  - [ ] Delegate to CssParser.Parse_CssValue() internally
  - [ ] Mark From_CSS(string) as [Obsolete]
- [ ] CssVarFunction (CSS/Types/)
  - [ ] Implement IParsable<CssVarFunction>
  - [ ] Tokenize → parse via CssVarFunctionParser
- [ ] CssEnvFunction (CSS/Types/)
  - [ ] Implement IParsable<CssEnvFunction>
  - [ ] Tokenize → parse via CssEnvFunctionParser
- [ ] CssCalcExpression (CSS/Types/)
  - [ ] Implement IParsable<CssCalcExpression>
  - [ ] Tokenize → parse via CssCalcFunctionParser
- [ ] CssUrl (CSS/Types/)
  - [ ] Implement IParsable<CssUrl>
  - [ ] Tokenize → parse via CssUrlFunctionParser

### 10.5 Call Site Migration
- [ ] Replace CssAnBParser.Parse(x) → CssAnB.Parse(x, null)
- [ ] Replace CssUnicodeRangeParser.Parse(x) → CssUnicodeRange.Parse(x, null)
- [ ] Replace CssValue.From_CSS(x) → CssValue.Parse(x, null)
- [ ] Replace Url.TryParse(x, out y) → Url.TryParse(x, null, out y)
- [ ] Enable generic T.Parse<T>() usage in utilities

### 10.6 Cleanup
- [ ] Mark deprecated Parse methods with [Obsolete] pointing to IParsable
- [ ] Keep internal TryParse(DataConsumer<CssToken>) overloads on parser classes
- [ ] Update XML documentation

